[node name="HelpText" type="Label" parent="HUD/MarginContainer/DebugSettings/Panel" unique_id=1644731599]
layout_mode = 1
anchors_preset = 15
anchor_right = 1.0
anchor_bottom = 1.0
grow_horizontal = 2
grow_vertical = 2
text = "Thank you for trying out my prototype :)

Hold the right mouse button to grapple.
Grappling moves the player towards the target, but also (even stronger) towards where the player is looking.

At the end of every grapple the player dashes towards where they are looking, but the y velocity is always positive 
(looking down on the ground results in dashing upwards)

Player has a double/air jump which is only active while falling (down). WASD affects air jump direction.

Hold Q to slow time for everything but looking around

Press CTRL to ground slam

[H] to hide"
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 2

